{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3gr6a9Ss41vxJrSC7D","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-bound, weathered by centuries of hands pressing against its grain.*\n\n*A single keyhole glows faintly at its center.*\n\nYou have presented: **key**\n\n*The tumbler turns. Something deep within the mechanism groans — metal teeth finding their mates, pins aligning one by one in sequence.*\n\n**CLUNK.**\n\n*The door shudders. A thin line of light splits vertically down the center, widening. Cool air rushes past you from the other side, carrying the scent of stone and rain and something older — something that has been waiting.*\n\n*The door swings open.*\n\n```\n ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\n ░░                   ░░\n ░░                   ░░\n ░░    You may pass   ░░\n ░░                   ░░\n ░░                   ░░\n ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\n```\n\n*Beyond: a corridor stretching into luminous dark. The walls breathe. The path descends.*\n\n*The door will not close behind you.*\n\n*The door will not need to.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":295,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}